VISUAL QA
Viewed both generated sheets, first split guides and both strips, then final _contact.png, _guides.png and both strips after retry.
Correct FRONT/BACK and LEFT/RIGHT order, full figures, no crop, no labels, empty hands, no pot/cart/chain, no glow. Same broad silhouette, cream/olive/terracotta masses and substantial cloth form shadows. No added muscle/claws/teeth. Front/back legs symmetric and narrow; side feet overlap with no visible stride. Top and soles aligned after split. Overall torso upright, short legs retained. Background close to grey, slightly mottled rather than perfectly flat. Surface folds somewhat more faceted/detailed than concept.
Not passed: arms sag; side hand is low and fingers curl rather than a clean flat open palm; crown/face vertically compressed against design landmarks; cloak too long and inconsistent across views. The side images are highly mirrored in appearance; removed chain leaves symmetric body, but exact seven-brick ring topology and rivet correspondence cannot be established confidently from overlaps.

